The `WCD_calculation` function is used to calculate the WCD of each flow. It takes into account the offset, cycle duration, switching delay, propagation delay, and time synchronization error to calculate the WCD.

The `reason` section of the JSON object provides the reason for each WCD calculation. It includes the path, cycle duration, Hypercycle, and CQF parameters used to calculate the WCD.

